(7287351, 1135613, 97905, '<td valign="top">a pity the focus got lost on this one - macro is ALL about the point of focus, you need to choose wisely and be precise while taking the picture. My eyes do not understand why the points of the picks are unsharp, while the uninteresting wood part below is in focus (for 2/3 of the picture) ;)</td>', 'a pity the focus got lost on this one - macro is ALL about the point of focus, you need to choose wisely and be precise while taking the picture. My eyes do not understand why the points of the picks are unsharp, while the uninteresting wood part below is in focus (for 2/3 of the picture) ;)', '2014-11-24 09:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
