(7287866, 1135722, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CBalck:</b></div><hr/><i> A tough subject.  Wish the focus were just a bit sharper. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would have liked that too, but without an actual macro lens, I didn''t really have any way of getting a deeper DOF.  It was quite difficult to get parts of the pin in focus.</td>', 'Originally posted by CBalck: A tough subject.  Wish the focus were just a bit sharper.   I would have liked that too, but without an actual macro lens, I didn''t really have any way of getting a deeper DOF.  It was quite difficult to get parts of the pin in focus.', '2014-11-26 07:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
